+
+## OpenRouter provider (my-tools)
+
+My Tools sends the same typed `state`/`questions` to the OpenRouter Decisions
+API (`https://openrouter.ai/api/alpha/decisions`, model `typesafe/jev-1.13`).
+The key is the `apiKey` option, else `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, else the private
+`~/.config/siftr/.env`; an explicitly empty variable disables the file. The
+compaction engine, thresholds, parser and fallback stay upstream. Compaction
+sends the session history to this provider: use it only where that history is
+authorized for external processing.
